---
title: PAdES Baseline Levels and Preservation Lifecycle - OmniSign
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 30
    rankSpacing: 55
    wrappingWidth: 380
---
flowchart TB
  subgraph LADDER["Level progression - ExtendDocumentUseCase"]
    B["PAdES-B (BASELINE_B)<br/>basic signature<br/>+ certificate chain"]
    BT["PAdES-B-T (BASELINE_T)<br/>+ RFC 3161<br/>trusted timestamp"]
    BLT["PAdES-B-LT (BASELINE_LT)<br/>+ revocation data<br/>(OCSP / CRL) + trust"]
    BLTA["PAdES-B-LTA (BASELINE_LTA)<br/>+ archive timestamp<br/>(long-term archival)"]
    B -->|"add timestamp"| BT
    BT -->|"embed revocation data"| BLT
    BLT -->|"add archive timestamp"| BLTA
  end

  subgraph ASSESS["CheckArchivalRenewalUseCase (periodic) - the verdict follows the level the document is at, because each level lacks something different and each gap has its own deadline"]
    direction LR
    A1["document is below B-LT<br/>reason: BELOW_LT<br/>no usable revocation data;<br/>deadline is the expiry of the<br/>signing certificate"]
    A2["document is at B-LT<br/>reason: LT_NOT_SEALED / LT_REFRESH_NEEDED<br/>revocation data is present, but nothing<br/>proves when it existed; deadline is the<br/>earlier of its nextUpdate and its issuer's expiry"]
    A3["document is at B-LTA<br/>reason: TIMESTAMP_EXPIRING / ALGORITHM_WEAKENING<br/>complete, and merely ages. Coverage-aware: a<br/>timestamp already sealed by a current document<br/>timestamp is ignored. renewalBufferDays<br/>(default 90) applies here only"]
  end

  OUT["RenewBatchUseCase<br/>applies the target level for the reason:<br/>B-LT for LT_REFRESH_NEEDED, B-LTA otherwise<br/>(BELOW_LT only when the job sets promoteBelowLt)"]
  DEAD["RenewalNeed.UNRECOVERABLE<br/>the deadline has already passed - no acceptable revocation<br/>data for the signature can be obtained ever again"]

  B -.-> A1
  BT -.-> A1
  BLT -.-> A2
  BLTA -.-> A3

  A1 --> OUT
  A2 --> OUT
  A3 --> OUT
  A1 -.->|"deadline already passed"| DEAD

  OUT -.->|"re-signed document is back at a protected level"| BLTA

  classDef level fill:#1168bd,stroke:#0b4884,color:#ffffff
  classDef decision fill:#fff8c5,stroke:#9a6700,color:#24292f
  classDef action fill:#2da44e,stroke:#0d4f22,color:#ffffff
  classDef dead fill:#8a8a8a,stroke:#5f5f5f,color:#ffffff
  class B,BT,BLT,BLTA level
  class A1,A2,A3 decision
  class OUT action
  class DEAD dead
